WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:11.664
Tired of plate math between sets? With Premium, RepBunny shows exactly what goes on each side of the bar.

2
00:00:12.018 --> 00:00:12.978
Here's how.

3
00:00:13.331 --> 00:00:16.931
Start a workout with a barbell lift, like bench press.

4
00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.283
Then tap the Plates button.

5
00:00:19.641 --> 00:00:26.521
It opens at your set's weight. For 145 pounds, that's a 45 and a 5 on each side.

6
00:00:26.885 --> 00:00:31.605
Going heavier? Tap the plus button to step up to the next weight you can load.

7
00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:35.646
Then tap the Use button, and the weight goes right into your set.
